{
  "source_id": "osdr_radlab",
  "title": "ISS RadLab (NASA OSDR) - DOSTEL absorbed dose rate in Columbus, aggregated to daily values",
  "urls": [
    "https://visualization.osdr.nasa.gov/radlab/api/?spacecraft=ISS&instrument=DosTel&timestamp>=<month start>&timestamp<<next month start>&absorbed_dose_rate&dose_equivalent_rate&module&format=csv",
    "https://visualization.osdr.nasa.gov/radlab/gui/data-api (documentation)"
  ],
  "license": "NASA OSDR open data (DORELI project data, ASI / DLR DOSTEL); cite NASA OSDR RadLab",
  "unit_source": "RadLab Data API documentation field table: absorbed_dose_rate = uGy/hour, dose_equivalent_rate = uSv/hour, flux = cm^-2 sr^-1 s^-1, altitude = km, B = nT",
  "notes": [
    "Raw data is ~2.5 MB per month (~90 MB/year, >50 MB limit), so only daily aggregates are kept; raw is fetched month by month and discarded. One raw day is kept in raw_sample/.",
    "The API also serves other ISS instruments (Lidal, REM/Timepix, Liulin-5); only DosTel is fetched here.",
    "DosTel data in RadLab spans roughly 2009 .. 2024 with gaps (e.g. none around 2012-01, 2023-09, after 2024-06/2024-12).",
    "Absorbed dose rate in silicon detector, not tissue; dose equivalent is not available for DosTel.",
    "API key syntax: bare key = add column, key=value filter, timestamp%3E= / timestamp%3C for ranges (see documentation)."
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "radlab_dostel_daily.csv",
      "bytes": 632776,
      "sha256": "0f276f3d5dadb658563b8a95781da3e30a84acdbe9bf16177be83f2ba23f2e2d",
      "rows": 8058,
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "date_utc",
          "unit": "YYYY-MM-DD (UTC)"
        },
        {
          "name": "instrument_id",
          "unit": "-",
          "description": "DosTel1 / DosTel2 (two telescopes of the DOSIS-3D DOSTEL instrument)"
        },
        {
          "name": "module",
          "unit": "-",
          "description": "ISS module where the detector was located (Columbus for DOSTEL)"
        },
        {
          "name": "n_samples",
          "unit": "count"
        },
        {
          "name": "coverage_hours",
          "unit": "h",
          "description": "sum of per-sample weights (time to next sample, capped at 300 s); <~20 h means incomplete day"
        },
        {
          "name": "absorbed_dose_rate_uGy_per_h_sample_mean",
          "unit": "uGy/h",
          "description": "plain mean of samples; biased high because cadence is denser inside the SAA"
        },
        {
          "name": "absorbed_dose_rate_uGy_per_h_time_weighted_mean",
          "unit": "uGy/h",
          "description": "time-weighted mean (recommended)"
        },
        {
          "name": "absorbed_dose_rate_uGy_per_h_min",
          "unit": "uGy/h"
        },
        {
          "name": "absorbed_dose_rate_uGy_per_h_max",
          "unit": "uGy/h"
        },
        {
          "name": "absorbed_dose_uGy_per_day_est",
          "unit": "uGy/day",
          "description": "time-weighted mean x 24 h"
        },
        {
          "name": "dose_equivalent_rate_uSv_per_h_time_weighted_mean",
          "unit": "uSv/h",
          "description": "empty for DosTel (not provided by the API for this instrument)"
        }
      ],
      "note": "dates 2009-07-31 .. 2024-11-04"
    },
